# Arrows Play release record: versionCode 24 (versionName 1.0.0), local bundleRelease from tag release/vc24 (no EAS).
# status: candidate
# The vc22 flag set unchanged. Replaces the vc23 candidate (built 2026-11-20, never uploaded) with the owner's splash pick
# (2026-11-20: "hop looks good ... include this in the build"): the "Hop" intro, and consent/AdMob/ambience start after
# the intro (cold-start jank fix). Otherwise as vc23, all unflagged: the Buddy mascot launcher icon in its Santa costume (ICON-01), the Buddy splash
# (violet; Buddy hops up, "Arrows" pops in letter by letter; snow + hill while the winter decor is in season), Buddy above "Arrows" as the
# menu logo, the violet window background (no white flash after the native splash), and the menu stats line on a chip
# over the winter hills (only while the winter decor shows). QA flags (QA_DATE, QA_WINTER_SWITCH, QA_SKINS_DRAWER, QA_SPLASH_*)
# and CAPTURE_DIAG are unset: no QA chips, real clock.
# Shell use: set -a; . release/vc24.env; set +a
# Checked by src/__tests__/releaseRecord.test.ts. History: never edit a shipped record; add vc<N>.env.
# consent: EXPO_PUBLIC_CONSENT_GATE=1. Google UMP runs before AdMob starts and fails closed: no ad until UMP resolves, none after a refusal. Needs the AdMob GDPR message published first, or EEA players get no ads.
